[Quotes]
victory1 = "Don't mistake my patience for cowardice."
victory2 = "Nothing I shoot ever gets back up again."
victory3 = "Yes...excellent! I haven't had this much fun in ages! ...What did you say your name was?"
victory4 = "If I'm a dog, then you're dog food."
victory5 = "The world would be so boring without idiots like you to amuse me."
victory6 = "Those who dare impersonate the dead are judged to join their ranks."
victory7 = "You fool...there's no such thing as an immortal!"
victory8 = "As a vampire, you were just a pathetic piece of shit. Now you're nothing but dog shit."
victory9 = "Only a human can destroy a monster. Only a human could dare hope to."
victory10 = "You are me... I was just the same! Don't you understand, this is how I became what I am?"
victory11 = "Until the weight of my past is shattered by my oncoming future. It shouldn't be too long, my nemesis. I'll see you in hell..."

[Statedef -2]
;Abstract Reordered: apply the colour slot that was picked (palettes 1,2..1,14 live inside the sprite file)
